## extras.rs

starting = # Starting
file-new-makes-illustration-comic-webtoon = File, New makes an illustration, a comic, a webtoon or an animation. File, Open reads pictures and Photoshop documents with their layers. Your work lives in the Sue project: Save Project keeps every picture, layer and page.
tools = # Tools
tool-strip-left-holds-tools-sub = The tool strip at the left holds the tools; the Sub Tool palette holds their variations and Tool Property their settings. Keys pick them as in Clip Studio Paint: P pen, B brush, E eraser, G fill, M selection, K move, I eyedropper, R ruler, T text, Y correct line.
alt-picks-color-while-drawing-space = Alt picks a color while drawing, Space scrolls, Space with Shift turns the view, Ctrl and Space zooms in and Alt and Space zooms out. Ctrl+Alt drags the brush size. File, Modifier Key Settings changes what Alt, Space and Ctrl+Shift do.
layers = # Layers
raster-layers-hold-pixels-vector-layers = Raster layers hold pixels, vector layers hold lines you can still edit (Correct Line), 3D layers draw a model you can turn. Folders group layers. The Layer Property palette adds a border, tones and an expression color; masks hide parts of a layer without erasing them.
colors = # Colors
color-wheel-color-slider-color-set = The Color Wheel, Color Slider, Color Set, Intermediate and Approximate Color palettes and the Color History all set the main color. X swaps the main and sub colors, C paints with the transparent color.
selections = # Selections
selection-tools-make-selection-launcher-under = The selection tools make a selection; the launcher under it offers what to do next. Quick Mask paints a selection. Select, Color Gamut picks by color.
pages-and-books = # Pages and books
comic-story-pages-story-menu-adds = A comic is a story of pages. The Story menu adds, moves and lays out pages, and exports them as pictures, a PDF or an EPUB. Window, Canvas, Tile shows several canvases at once.
animation-2 = # Animation
animation-timeline-new-timeline-starts-animation = Animation, Timeline, New Timeline starts an animation. Each animation folder is a track of cels; New Animation Cel draws a new one at the frame shown. Onion skin and the light table help in between. File, Import, Movie brings a GIF, PNG, WebP or AVI in as cels, File, Import, Audio puts sound on the timeline.
repeating-work = # Repeating work
auto-actions-navigator-palette-records-menu = Auto Actions (in the Navigator palette) records menu commands and plays them back. The Item Bank keeps sub tools to add again. Window, Workspace keeps a palette layout by name.
exporting = # Exporting
file-export-writes-png-jpeg-jpeg = File, Export writes PNG, JPEG, JPEG XL, BMP, TIFF, TGA, PSD and PSB. File, Print lays the pages on paper and opens them in your PDF viewer.
